=== interpretation (asymmetric, pre-registered) ===
No strong temperature effect on CYP51 transcript is detected.
This FAILS TO CONTRADICT the constant-abundance assumption. It does NOT
establish it: transcript is not protein, three temperatures is not seven,
and the test has limited power. No positive claim follows.
